000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SUBADD.
000300*    a called subprogram: adds its input to 1000 and reports back
000400 DATA DIVISION.
000500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000600 01  WS-T PIC S9(8) COMP VALUE 0.
000700 LINKAGE SECTION.
000800 01  LS-IN.
000900     05  IN-VAL   PIC S9(8) COMP.
001000 01  LS-OUT.
001100     05  OUT-VAL  PIC S9(8) COMP.
001200     05  OUT-TAG  PIC X(4).
001300 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-IN LS-OUT.
001400 MAIN-PARA.
001500     MOVE IN-VAL TO WS-T.
001600     ADD 1000 TO WS-T.
001700     MOVE WS-T TO OUT-VAL.
001800     MOVE 'DONE' TO OUT-TAG.
001810* The return code goes back in R15, and the caller's CALL leaves
001820* it in RETURN-CODE: 3 for an input of 7, 0 otherwise.
001830     IF IN-VAL = 7 MOVE 3 TO RETURN-CODE
001840     ELSE MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE.
001900     GOBACK.
